    `isLoading`), fed by SecurityStatusCards; the native source carries that parent
    snapshot. No HTTP in the view.
  - Composition (web grid of 4 <MetricCard> / loading <Skeleton>):
      • <MetricCard label value icon color> -> SSRMetricTile: tinted SF Symbol badge
        (web c.bg/c.ring/c.text) + label (Font.TS.label) + bold value (Font.TS.title,
        text-primary). Four tiles: status (shield, green/red) · last-lock (clock,
        cyan) · sentry-uptime (waveform, blue) · total-events (chart.bar, purple).
      • color NeonColor -> brand token (ADR-006 semantic): green=statusSuccess,
        red=statusDanger, cyan=accent, blue=chartSeriesSpeed, purple=chartSeriesPower.
      • <Skeleton height={88}> ×4 -> TSSkeleton(height:88) in the same grid.
      • <FadeIn> -> TSFadeIn (data branch only, matching the source).
      • grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 -> SummaryStatsLayout.columnCount
        (640/1024 breakpoints) driven by onGeometryChange. Unit-tested.
  - Helpers: `timeSince` floor-ladder ported verbatim (just-now/Nm/Nh/Nd, '—' for
    missing/future/unparseable) as semantic SummaryRelativeTime so the wording
    localises in the view (web hardcodes English; native must not). `fmtInt`
    (safeNumber→0, grouping, round-half-up, 0 fraction digits) ported for the "%"
    value; totalEvents rendered raw (web `value={totalEvents}`, no grouping).

